<section class="app-page active" data-page-panel="dashboard">
  <div class="hero-panel"><div><span class="status-pill"><i class="bi bi-circle-fill"></i><span id="hero-status">缓存模式</span></span><h2 id="server-name">选择幻兽帕鲁服务器</h2><p id="server-description">服务器在线时自动刷新实时数据，离线也能查看本地缓存内容。</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="sync"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-2"></i>立即同步</button><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i>游戏内广播</button></div></div>
  <div class="metric-grid metric-grid-6">
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon violet"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></span><div><small>在线玩家</small><strong id="metric-players">— / —</strong><span>当前在线 / 服务器最大人数</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon blue"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i></span><div><small>游戏版本</small><strong id="metric-version">—</strong><span>服务端当前版本</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon green"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></span><div><small>运行时长</small><strong id="metric-uptime">—</strong><span>服务器进程已运行时长</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon amber"><i class="bi bi-sun"></i></span><div><small>游戏天数</small><strong id="metric-day">—</strong><span>游戏世界内天数</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon blue"><i class="bi bi-speedometer"></i></span><div><small>服务器帧率</small><strong id="metric-fps">—</strong><span>实时运行帧率</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon violet"><i class="bi bi-stopwatch"></i></span><div><small>单帧耗时</small><strong id="metric-frame-time">—</strong><span>单位：毫秒</span></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="content-grid"><article class="surface span-2"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>数据状态</h3><p>远程服务器连接状态与本地缓存情况</p></div><span id="cache-badge" class="soft-badge">暂无缓存数据</span></div><div class="empty-state compact" id="health-content"><i class="bi bi-database"></i><strong>先选择服务器，即可加载对应数据</strong></div></article><article class="surface"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>快捷功能</h3><p>常用远程管理命令快捷入口</p></div></div><div class="quick-actions"><button data-command="Save"><i class="bi bi-cloud-check"></i><span><strong>保存世界存档</strong><small>立刻将游戏进度保存至服务器</small></span></button><button data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i><span><strong>游戏内广播</strong><small>给所有在线玩家发送公告消息</small></span></button><button data-navigate="players"><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill"></i><span><strong>玩家列表</strong><small>查看、筛选本地缓存的玩家信息</small></span></button></div></article></div>
</section>
